# 2. Player Entry Models

RADAS OIL supports two starting routes.

## Free Player

**Entry Cost:** USD 0

Receives:

  Item                Specification
  ------------------- ----------------------------
  Starting Asset      Starter Well
  Well Value          Non-tradable starter asset
  Starting Storage    100 BBL
  Starting RDO        0
  Output              5 BBL / cycle
  Cycle               2 hours
  Durability          100
  Tradable            No
  Upgradeable         Yes
  SOL Reward Access   Locked initially

Purpose:

The Starter Well allows anyone to learn the game and slowly build an oil
operation without depositing money.

``` text
FREE
 ↓
Starter Well
 ↓
Mine Oil
 ↓
Sell Oil
 ↓
Earn RDO
 ↓
Upgrade
 ↓
Build/Mint Standard Well
```

The free route must remain viable, but intentionally slower than the
capital route.

------------------------------------------------------------------------

## USD 100 Player

**Entry Target:** approximately USD 100 equivalent

Receives/builds:

  Item                 Specification
  -------------------- ----------------------------------------------
  Starting Asset       Standard Well
  Target Entry Value   USD 100 equivalent
  Starting Storage     500 BBL
  Output               30 BBL / cycle
  Cycle                2 hours
  Durability           100
  Tradable             Future phase
  Upgradeable          Yes
  SOL Reward Access    Eligible after minimum activity requirements

``` text
≈ USD 100
    ↓
Standard Well
    ↓
Faster Oil Production
    ↓
Sell Oil
    ↓
RDO
    ↓
Repair / Upgrade / New Well
    ↓
Reward Eligibility
```

**Design principle:**

> Capital buys speed and productive capacity. It does not buy guaranteed
> profit.

