# 9. Storage Progression

Oil that exceeds storage capacity cannot be collected.

This forces players to balance production and infrastructure.

  Storage Level       Capacity   Upgrade Cost
  --------------- ------------ --------------
  LV1                  100 BBL           Free
  LV2                  500 BBL         10 RDO
  LV3                1,500 BBL         35 RDO
  LV4                5,000 BBL        100 RDO
  LV5               15,000 BBL        300 RDO

USD 100 Standard Well players may begin with 500 BBL capacity so the
purchased asset is immediately usable.

