# 13. Economic Sinks

RADAS OIL requires continuous reasons to spend resources.

Primary V1 sinks:

``` text
RDO
├── Mint Well
├── Repair Well
├── Upgrade Well
├── Upgrade Storage
└── Future Platform Upgrade

OIL
├── Mint requirements
├── Future fuel/energy
└── Future processing
```

Without sufficient sinks:

``` text
More Players
   ↓
More Production
   ↓
More RDO
   ↓
More Sell Pressure
   ↓
Economy Weakens
```

Therefore production expansion must always create additional operating
or progression costs.

