# 16. V1 Economy Rules

1.  OIL is the primary produced resource.
2.  RDO is the utility/reward currency.
3.  SOL is an external reward layer, not the mining resource.
4.  OIL has no guaranteed SOL conversion.
5.  RDO has no guaranteed SOL conversion.
6.  Free players can eventually reach the main economy.
7.  USD 100 players start faster with a Standard Well.
8.  Paid entry does not guarantee profit.
9.  Wells require maintenance.
10. Minting and upgrades remove resources from circulation.
11. Higher production must create higher operating costs.
12. SOL rewards come only from a finite Reward Pool.
13. Daily SOL claims are capped.
14. Reward parameters must remain configurable.
15. Economy numbers must be simulated before blockchain deployment.
16. Blockchain integration comes after gameplay/economy validation.

