# 18. What Must Be Simulated Before Launch

Before Economy V1 is considered final, simulate at minimum:

-   100 players.
-   1,000 players.
-   10,000 players.
-   Free-to-paid conversion.
-   Average collections per day.
-   Average missed cycles.
-   RDO creation per day.
-   RDO burn per day.
-   Repair expenditure.
-   Upgrade expenditure.
-   New Well mint frequency.
-   SOL Reward Pool inflow.
-   SOL Reward Pool outflow.
-   Whale/multi-well behaviour.
-   Multi-account abuse.
-   30-day, 90-day and 365-day economy projections.

Primary target:

``` text
RDO Burn + Utility Demand
must remain meaningful relative to
RDO Production
```

External reward target:

``` text
SOL Outflow
must never systematically exceed
the sustainable Reward Pool
```

